### Sign in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lucky-wheel/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin123",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Sign out
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lucky-wheel/sign-out

### Session check or get token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lucky-wheel/session-token


### get all wheel items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lucky-wheel/secure/wheel-item

